  "zh": "# 全国新教材替换完成；华为小米回应涨价；中国机器鸭出海断货\n\n## AI与科技\n- **Anthropic发布Claude Fable 5.1**：新版模型支持AI生成动画短片，创意工具能力大幅提升\n- **OpenAI发布Path to Astra安全路线图**：明确前沿模型安全标准，AI治理框架逐步成型\n\n## 行业动向\n- **华为小米荣耀回应手机涨价**：供应链成本压力下国产旗舰集体调价，消费者需早做预算\n- **中国机器鸭海外卖断货**：深圳团队设计的智能玩具鸭席卷亚马逊，Temu出海爆款逻辑显现\n\n## 国际视野\n- **秘鲁宣布与伊朗断交**：中东地缘政治连锁反应持续，南美外交格局出现新变动\n- **尼泊尔泥石流遇难者过千人**：极端天气致重大伤亡，我救援力量已抵达边境口岸协助搜救",
  "en": "# China Replaces All Textbooks Nationally; Phone Makers Address Price Hikes; Chinese Robot Duck Sells Out Abroad\n\n## AI & Tech\n- **Anthropic Releases Claude Fable 5.1**: New model enables AI-generated animated shorts, dramatically expanding creative tools\n- **OpenAI Publishes Path to Astra Safety Roadmap**: Outlines frontier model safety standards, signaling maturing AI governance\n\n## Industry Trends\n- **Huawei, Xiaomi, Honor Respond to Phone Price Hikes**: Supply chain costs force flagship price increases across Chinese brands\n- **Chinese Robot Duck Sells Out Overseas**: Shenzhen team's smart toy duck dominates Amazon and Temu, revealing cross-border hit formula\n\n## Global Affairs\n- **Peru Cuts Diplomatic Ties with Iran**: Middle East geopolitical fallout continues reshaping South American relations\n- **Nepal Landslide Death Toll Surpasses 1,000**: Extreme weather causes catastrophic casualties; Chinese rescue teams arrive at border crossing"
